Step 9: Route Precedence

The module introduced route selection behavior.

Azure determines which route to use based on route precedence.

Route priority order:
User-Defined Routes (UDRs)
BGP Routes
System Routes
Key concepts learned:
Custom routes override system routes
Route specificity matters
Azure automatically selects the most specific route

Understanding route precedence is important for troubleshooting connectivity issues.

