Key Takeaway

Azure routing determines how traffic moves between resources, networks, and external destinations. By implementing User-Defined Routes and Network Virtual Appliances, Azure Administrators can gain greater control over traffic flow, improve security through inspection and filtering, and build scalable enterprise networking architectures that meet organizational security and compliance requirements.
